            "speaker_id": 333646,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, kicking off the 'Standardised Accounting and Move-Cost Tracking' project. The main goal is to get a unified process for all relocation jobs. I've created a first draft of the new chart of accounts, please see A1. The main task for this week is T1. Let me know your thoughts.",
