            "speaker_id": 333646,
            "reply_to": "M6",
            "text": "That's a great point. It adds a bit of complexity but the payoff in reporting quality is worth it. Does everyone agree with splitting 'Transport Costs' into 'Local Transport' and 'Long-Haul Transport'?",
            "mentions": [
