            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Afternoon team. I've created the first drafts for the 'Relocation Job Costing Template' (A3) and the 'Monthly Reconciliation Checklist' (A4). They are aligned with our new chart of accounts. Please take a look and share your feedback. This covers tasks T3 and T4.",
