          {
            "msg_id": "M43",
            "speaker_id": 254387,
            "reply_to": "M39",
            "text": "In A3, I see lines for labor and transport, but what about specialized equipment rental? For some industrial moves, that's a significant cost. We should have a dedicated line for it rather than lumping it into other costs.",
