          {
            "msg_id": "M46",
            "speaker_id": 449944,
            "reply_to": "M45",
            "text": "Regarding A4, I'd argue that reconciling the suspense account should be a weekly task, not monthly. Especially with a new process, we want to catch and correct posting errors quickly. Leaving it for a month-end could create a lot of rework.",
            "mentions": [],
