            "speaker_id": 456000,
            "reply_to": "M46",
            "text": "I strongly agree. Weekly for suspense, monthly for the rest. That's a good balance between control and workload.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M48",
            "speaker_id": 333646,
            "reply_to": "M47",
            "text": "Makes sense. I'll update A4 to reflect a weekly frequency for the suspense account reconciliation and monthly for the others. So, to summarize the proposed changes: A3 will get an added line for equipment rental and better formatting. A4 will have a weekly step for the suspense account. Any other feedback?",
